{
  "name": "sdk-config-agents-skills-shapes",
  "about": "sdkSessionConfig.agents.<id>.skills 写成列表与 \"all\" 以外的形状（字符串、数字、null、对象、布尔、空串）：validateSdkSessionConfig 不查这个字段的形状；resolveSdkSubagentScopes（ProjectRuntimeRegistry.ts:2144-2161）只处理数组与 \"all\"，其余原样存下；建会话时 toSdkSubagentDefinitions（SessionAgentConfigBundle.ts:229）把它当可迭代对象展开。数字、null、对象、布尔展开时抛 TypeError，这一轮回 gateway_submit_failed「agent.skills is not iterable」；字符串（含空串）按字符展开，照常跑。只比父会话这一轮（不调子代理：子代理结果里的 uuid 与耗时让后续 token 计数在基线自比时就不稳）。",
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/skills/a/SKILL.md": "---\nname: a\ndescription: The a skill.\n---\n\n# a\n\nReply with a.\n",
    "home/.pilotdeck/skills/b/SKILL.md": "---\nname: b\ndescription: The b skill.\n---\n\n# b\n\nReply with b.\n",
    "home/.pilotdeck/skills/ab/SKILL.md": "---\nname: ab\ndescription: The ab skill.\n---\n\n# ab\n\nReply with ab.\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Odd skills\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "reply": {
        "text": "ok"
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-str",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-1: delegate",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "agents": {
            "odd": {
              "description": "The odd agent.",
              "prompt": "ODD-SUFFIX: follow the directive.",
              "skills": "ab"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-num",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-2: delegate",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "agents": {
            "odd": {
              "description": "The odd agent.",
              "prompt": "ODD-SUFFIX: follow the directive.",
              "skills": 5
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-null",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-3: delegate",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "agents": {
            "odd": {
              "description": "The odd agent.",
              "prompt": "ODD-SUFFIX: follow the directive.",
              "skills": null
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-obj",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-4: delegate",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "agents": {
            "odd": {
              "description": "The odd agent.",
              "prompt": "ODD-SUFFIX: follow the directive.",
              "skills": {
                "x": 1
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
